@startuml selma_conflict_resolution
' ============================================================
' Selma — Conflict Resolution State Machine
' Source:  SPECIFICATION.md §2.15, §2.15.1, §2.15.2
'          User_Stories.md S-05, S-28
' C4:      Conflict Resolver
'          artifacts → Snapshots Adapter → artifact_store
'          denials → Findings & Audit Trail Adapter → event_store
' Contract: 8.2.4
'
' Precedence (normative, lower priority_level wins):
'   1. Explicit override (always_wins / never_wins / defer_to)
'   2. Compatible dual overrides (compatible_overrides)
'   3. Priority: constitutional=1 > statutory=2 > regulatory=3
'                > operational=4 > advisory=5
'   4. Specificity (higher score wins)
'   5. Recency (newer created_at wins; frozen in node_body)
'   6. Conflict Artifact → human conflict.resolve
'
' Within-lineage = binding. Cross-lineage = advisory only.
' ============================================================

title Selma — Conflict Resolution FSM\n<size:12><i>Deterministic cascade · binding within-lineage · advisory cross-lineage · human artifact path</i></size>

!include ./common/sm_styles.puml

[*] --> DetectPair : consistency review\nor multi-rule fire\non frozen CG-IR\nstory: S-05 / S-28

state "Detect\nConflicting Pair" as DetectPair #B9770E : declared conflicts_with\nor outcome contradiction\n(same lineage, both Fail,\ncontradictory deontics)
state "No Conflict" as NoConflict #2C6E49 : no pair / both Pass\nPass+Fail / same-type Fail
state "Scope Check" as ScopeCheck #1B7A6E : share lineage_id?

DetectPair --> NoConflict : no candidate
DetectPair --> ScopeCheck : candidate pair
NoConflict --> [*]

ScopeCheck --> ExplicitOverride : same lineage_id\n**binding cascade**
ScopeCheck --> AdvisoryCascade : different lineage_id\n**advisory only**

' ---------- Within-lineage binding cascade (flat, no nested exits) ----------
state "1. Explicit\nOverride" as ExplicitOverride #1B7A6E : always_wins |\nnever_wins |\ndefer_to (execution id)
state "2. Compatible\nOverrides" as CompatibleOverrides #1B7A6E : compatible_overrides()\nsymmetric pairs or\nidentical defer_to
state "3. Priority" as PriorityCheck #1B7A6E : lower priority_level wins\n1 constitutional ... 5 advisory
state "4. Specificity" as SpecificityCheck #1B7A6E : score =\nscope_specificity x 100 +\nbound_fields
state "5. Recency" as RecencyCheck #1B7A6E : newer created_at\nfrozen in node_body
state "Resolved\nBinding" as ResolvedBinding #2C6E49 : winner recorded\nloser adjusted
state "Conflict Artifact\nPending" as ArtifactPending #A93226 : requires human\nconflict.resolve

ExplicitOverride --> ResolvedBinding : single override wins
ExplicitOverride --> CompatibleOverrides : none / dual / ambiguous

CompatibleOverrides --> ResolvedBinding : compatible pair
CompatibleOverrides --> ArtifactPending : incompatible dual
CompatibleOverrides --> PriorityCheck : no override

PriorityCheck --> ResolvedBinding : strict winner
PriorityCheck --> SpecificityCheck : tie

SpecificityCheck --> ResolvedBinding : strict winner
SpecificityCheck --> RecencyCheck : tie

RecencyCheck --> ResolvedBinding : later created_at
RecencyCheck --> ArtifactPending : identical timestamp

ResolvedBinding --> [*]

' ---------- Human artifact lifecycle ----------
state "Human Review" as HumanReview #B9770E : Official reviews artifact\n[capability: conflict.resolve]
state "Artifact\nResolved" as ArtifactResolved #2C6E49 : decision recorded\non same frozen snapshot
state "Artifact\nRejected" as ArtifactRejected #A93226 : no change · remains open
state "Artifact\nArchived" as ArtifactArchived #4A4A4A : immutable retention

ArtifactPending --> HumanReview : escalate
HumanReview --> ArtifactResolved : resolve recorded
HumanReview --> ArtifactRejected : deny / defer
ArtifactResolved --> ArtifactArchived
ArtifactRejected --> HumanReview : reopen review
ArtifactArchived --> [*]

' ---------- Cross-lineage advisory ----------
state "Run Precedence\nRead-Only" as AdvisoryCascade #1B7A6E : same cascade\nno binding mutation
state "Advisory\nArtifact" as AdvisoryArtifact #B9770E : binding_status=advisory\nrequires_human_action=true\nMUST NOT modify findings/CG-IR
state "No Advisory" as NoAdvisory #2C6E49

AdvisoryCascade --> AdvisoryArtifact : conflict signal
AdvisoryCascade --> NoAdvisory : no residual conflict
AdvisoryArtifact --> [*]
NoAdvisory --> [*]

note left of ExplicitOverride
  **Within-lineage binding (S-28)**
  identical frozen CG-IR + target
  => byte-identical outcomes including
  compatible_overrides pairs.
  defer_to: self-ref / missing => fall through;
  multi-active post-fork => Artifact;
  cycles (DFS) => ignore all defer_to.
end note

note right of AdvisoryCascade
  **§2.15.2 invariant**
  Cross-lineage resolution is advisory.
  No automatic finding FSM mutation.
  No CG-IR rewrite.
  Humans change directives => recompile.
end note

note bottom of HumanReview
  **Security**
  Only Regulatory Official with
  conflict.resolve. Deny => artifact stays
  open; denial audit appended; no partial
  resolution write.
end note

@enduml
